perfectly with the university's strategic priorities.\"}, {\"id\": \"s16\", \"text\": \"The institution's emphasis on interdisciplinary research, its focus on addressing real-world problems, and its commitment to fostering a culture of innovation all resonate deeply with Edrine's academic philosophy.\"}]}"
